        "slc_553341a0fa2bd98a2c1ac03e66b0f09b4253efc49ad659cc7d0d59de2a1fa38d"
      ],
      "text": "Boomerang summarizes only context/tokens and never touches file state; all file changes made during a task are preserved on disk."
    },
